  },
  "section": "8.7",
  "rulesText": "If you have Advantage on a D20 Test, roll two d20s, and use the higher roll. A roll can't be affected by more than one Advantage, and Advantage and Disadvantage on the same roll cancel each other. See also \"Playing the Game\" (\"D20 Tests\").",
